{"name": "Junkster", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Junkster is an all-new 3D action platforming adventure with a unique building mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675860/extras/057f2669d38a6b5d7732b262ee37d11b.poster.avif?t=1781988439\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675860/extras/057f2669d38a6b5d7732b262ee37d11b.webm?t=1781988439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675860/extras/057f2669d38a6b5d7732b262ee37d11b.mp4?t=1781988439\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When an intergalactic cargo ship crash-lands on a dangerous junkyard planet, it is up to a scrappy, little construction bot named UM-13, or UM for short, to save the day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675860/extras/01376df12a04efb2b67e1a0fef33b0f6.poster.avif?t=1781988439\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675860/extras/01376df12a04efb2b67e1a0fef33b0f6.webm?t=1781988439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675860/extras/01376df12a04efb2b67e1a0fef33b0f6.mp4?t=1781988439\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armed only with his trusty robo-wrench, UM must transform the galaxy\u2019s useless garbage into slightly more functional garbage as he searches for the parts to repair his ship and recovers his lost cargo of precious human artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675860/extras/624168d1e288d5448d018f3292e1a7b0.poster.avif?t=1781988439\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675860/extras/624168d1e288d5448d018f3292e1a7b0.webm?t=1781988439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675860/extras/624168d1e288d5448d018f3292e1a7b0.mp4?t=1781988439\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a visual style that captures the retro vibe of 80's era American comicbooks, each action-packed issue sees Um go toe-to-robot-toe with hungry trash mutants and renegade bots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And as a special bonus, each exciting issue comes complete with a Junkster toy to add to your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675860/extras/4f00c98e0f5a9d08c19ded9bc78340ca.poster.avif?t=1781988439\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675860/extras/4f00c98e0f5a9d08c19ded9bc78340ca.webm?t=1781988439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675860/extras/4f00c98e0f5a9d08c19ded9bc78340ca.mp4?t=1781988439\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Junkster is a 3D action platformer with an awesome building mechanic. Plucky little construction bot, UM-13 (or Um for short), has crash-landed on a dangerous junkyard planet. Armed only with his trusty robo-wrench, Um must repair his ship and recover his lost cargo of precious human artifacts.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675860/1a3fc88ff380ba9bcb6d325fce4f8c710c56507e/header.jpg?t=1781988439", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Singleplayer", "3D Platformer", "Collectathon", "Funny", "Adventure", "Indie"], "developers": "Stormcloud Games Limited", "publishers": "Stormcloud Games Limited", "release_date": "Jun 16, 2026", "price": "$9.99", "appid": "1675860", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "11 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/fLil7lEbgzA", "first_seen": 1770764400.0, "review_rank": 1249}